---
/* =============================================================================
   NewTabNote.astro — tells screen-reader users a link opens a new tab.
   =============================================================================
   Sighted visitors see the ↗ arrow on external links; this hidden text gives
   screen-reader users the same warning. `sr-only` is a Tailwind class that
   hides text visually but keeps it readable by assistive tech.

   Usage: put it inside any link with target="_blank", after the visible text:
     <a href="…" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗<NewTabNote /></a>
============================================================================= */
---

<span class="sr-only"> (opens in new tab)</span>
